# hangedman_zot_decor_scrapings keeps its authored Zot geometry and source selectors.
# Named Lua hooks below perform only the source decisions that
# cannot remain static DES directives.
# Source: crawl-ref/source/dat/des/branches/zot.des.
NAME:    hangedman_zot_decor_scrapings
TAGS:    transparent extra
DEPTH:   Zot
KFEAT:   Z = zot trap
SHUFFLE: HIJKLM / HIJKLM / IHKJML
SUBST:   HJL : xxcb, I : x..., K : x..., M : x...
SUBST:   N : xcG.., O : xc..., P : xcG.., Z = ()G .:45 Z:25
MAP
           ..   ...
          .......x..
         ..x......x..
        ....x..O......
    ................x..
   ..J...P...L...N.I.H.
  ..x.x.....x.x.....x..
 ....K...M.Z.M...K....
..x.....x.x.....x.x...
.H.I.N...L...P...J...
..x.................
 ......O...x....
  ..x.......x..
   ..x........
    ...    ..
ENDMAP
